_cn":"照看后，梅丽莎终于呜咽着醒来","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596E1F2178BC7979","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120405010:0":{"text":"ガリ……これ、ガリの筆跡です……彼には毎回調査レポートを見せてもらってましたから……","source_cn":"伽利……这是伽利的字迹……他每次写完勘探报告都会给我看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF220F0DB54454D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120405011:0":{"text":"ガリ、どうして……！ううぅぅ……！","source_cn":"伽利，为什么……！呜呜呜呜……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F4938B8A8AE22F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120405012:0":{"text":"メリッサさん……","source_cn":"梅丽莎……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577D4C0E822EE553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1120405012":{"text":"メリッサさん……","source_cn":"梅丽莎……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577D4C0E822EE553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120405013:0":{"text":"……だ、大丈夫です……泣いてばかりじゃいけません……","source_cn":"……我，没事……我不能只流眼泪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABE41FF459F66BAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_recor